{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And his brothers envied him.</b> In this dream they removed the doubt they had concerning the first dream, which had come because of his thoughts — for surely he had not thought, nor had it entered his mind, to rule over his father. This could only be a communication from heaven, and therefore envy entered them."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:46:26.815331385Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}